close_reason: "Shipped commit-time lease fencing: acquireLockLease(...).fence(commit) verifies the lease token under the per-lock cleanup gate shared with stale takeover; mutateItem, deleteItem and restore fence their writes; item mutations also refuse stale_revision when the stored bytes changed after the read."
